  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organisational Capacity Strengthening Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following recent expansion, Caritas Kenya seeks to achieve the following in this one-year capacity-strengthening project: 
1. Enhance its capacity to undertake its coordination, facilitation and representation roles, through: developing a 10-Year strategic plan; staff skills development; Caritas &#x2018;brand&#x2019; development (website design; and management, visibility material development, etc.) and purchasing office equipment.
2. Improve coordination, information sharing and learning among diocesan Caritas offices and Caritas International member organisations, through meetings and forums at country and diocesan level. 
3. Improve the capacity of selected diocesan Caritas offices to deliver quality services in social development through such  training measures as: national workshop on local resource mobilization and business model building; solidarity visits to diocesan Caritas offices and staff skills development on identified training needs.</narrative>
  </description>
